{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/e7f23aaf01d4d58f9a5ffd03837452b7.webp?t=1766106095\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the galaxy? Boring. <strong>You want the fame.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Arc Galaxy is a flawless, utopian civilisation obsessed with perfection. It is suffocating, and you are the glitch it fears. Play as <strong>Dylo</strong>, a glory-seeking rebel, in this lightning-fast combat arena <strong>shooter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of <strong>arcades</strong> and fueled by a thumping <strong>synthwave</strong> soundtrack, your mission is simple: Defeat <strong>The Shadow</strong>, feed your ego, and uncover the dark lie behind the perfection. Speed is your shield. Hesitation is a glitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/04f171763f88a88356933d42468b1c11.poster.avif?t=1766106095\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/04f171763f88a88356933d42468b1c11.webm?t=1766106095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/04f171763f88a88356933d42468b1c11.mp4?t=1766106095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/15762fb5cc5412e96165246a2e92b83b.webp?t=1766106095\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't just a pilot; you are a force of chaos. To survive the onslaught, you must master <strong>dynamic systems</strong> that reward aggression and punish mistakes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Super Sonic Dash</u></strong><u>:</u> Movement is your weapon. Reach blinding velocities to cross the map instantly and trigger massive shockwaves on impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Crowd Control</u></strong><u>:</u> Use your speed to disperse enemies when they try to corner you. Never stop moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Ego &amp; Reputation</u></strong><u>:</u> You fight for glory. Your combat efficiency dictates your standing. Play poorly, and you are nobody. Play perfectly, and become a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dynamic Difficulty</u></strong><u>:</u> The game watches you. If you dominate, it fights back harder. If you struggle, it gives you a chance to recover. It evolves with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Allies</u></strong><u>:</u> You prefer to work alone, but backup arrives when chaos spirals out of control. Just don't let them steal your kills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mastery</strong>:</u> There is no luck here. Only muscle memory and reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/0cb76e08fbf9169b84ee16b02d629121.webp?t=1766106095\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/ff725def1cab38478bb045b5a9c749a4.poster.avif?t=1766106095\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/ff725def1cab38478bb045b5a9c749a4.webm?t=1766106095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/ff725def1cab38478bb045b5a9c749a4.mp4?t=1766106095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Utopia is beautiful, but it is a cage. Battle across distinct <strong>planets</strong>, from sun-drenched golden beaches to the suffocating depths of ancient, moss-covered forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>sector</strong> is a battlefield with its own lore and hazards. You aren't here to sightsee; you are here to break the order. Explore a meticulously crafted universe that reacts to your presence and uncover the secrets buried beneath the &quot;perfect&quot; surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/8c8a4e65325318efe377fa5880831050.webp?t=1766106095\" width=607 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras/3ee7b47b400460b80b03c6ce5b2f142b.avif?t=1766106095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656690/extras_big/3ee7b47b400460b80b03c6ce5b2f142b.webp?t=1766106095 width=1600 height=651 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dylo is not a typical hero. He is flawed, rude, and guided by emotion in a world of cold logic. But he is not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of characters fighting to feel something real in a collapsing galaxy. From <strong>Orbo</strong>, your loyal Golden Retriever and moral anchor, to the allies who challenge your stubbornness. Their stories are not just background noise; they are the heart of your rebellion. In a war for the soul of the galaxy, connections are the only thing that can keep you human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset